    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create the file `embed_for_search.py` that embeds a query and documents for semantic search using a concrete external provider. I will use the Amazon Bedrock service for this task, as it is a concrete external provider that offers embeddings capabilities. </thinking>\n",
